# third_party/gaio

## Purpose
Preserved local fork/module for `github.com/xtaci/gaio`, kept outside LumiNet live source.

## Contents
- The upstream Go module is rooted directly in this directory.
- `LUMINET.md` documents why LumiNet carries the local fork.
- Upstream examples, assets, CI metadata, license, and README remain otherwise intact.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- `src/apps/daemon/go.mod` maps `github.com/xtaci/gaio` here with a `replace` directive.

## Invariants
- Treat upstream files as third-party provenance, not LumiNet-owned modules.
- Do not inject LumiNet metadata into nested upstream folders.
